              "MS-TR-2025Q4#20",
              "MS-SUPP-2025Q4#14"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Morgan Stanley Wealth Management reported net new assets of $118 billion in Q1 2026.",
            "quote": "The business added net new assets of $118 billion and fee-based asset flows were $54 billion.",
            "value": "$118 billion",
            "unit": "USD",
