            "scope": "Wealth Management",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "MS-10Q-2026Q1#18",
              "MS-TR-2026Q1#3"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Morgan Stanley Wealth Management reported net new assets of $148 billion in Q2 2026, of which just over half represented inflows related to IPOs of certain clients in the Workplace channel.",
            "quote": "The business added net new assets of $148 billion and fee-based assets of $39 billion.",
