            "unit": "USD",
            "period": "2026Q2",
            "scope": "Wealth Management",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "MS-10Q-2026Q2#18",
              "MS-TR-2026Q2#16"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Morgan Stanley Wealth Management reported net new assets of $232 billion in Q3 2026, with just over half associated with IPO-related flows.",
            "quote": "net new assets of $232 billion reflect the strength of our core business and the differentiated growth opportunities created by Workplace and the integrated firm.",
